{"id":"eed77950d006550e","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-inner3-approachability-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Inner3 Approachability Ideal","display":"df-zfc-inner3-approachability-ideal — ZFC Inner3 Approachability Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner3-approachability-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner3-approachability-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-inner3-approachability-ideal — ZFC Inner3 Approachability Ideal","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachability-ideal-member]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner3-approachability-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner3-approachability-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner3-approachability-ideal — ZFC Inner3 Approachability Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"43dc0a00cf0bc7e0\" href=\"?note=43dc0a00cf0bc7e0\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachability-ideal-member\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachability-ideal-member</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,I\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,I\\in V\\)</span> (regular uncountable cardinal and approachability-ideal candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachabilityIdealMember}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachabilityIdealMember}_S\\)</span> (canonical membership predicate for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I[\\kappa]\">\\(I[\\kappa]\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3ApproachabilityIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3ApproachabilityIdeal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}approachability\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner3ApproachabilityIdeal}_S(\\kappa,I)\\leftrightarrow I=\\{A\\subseteq\\kappa\\mid\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachabilityIdealMember}_S(\\kappa,A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}approachability\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner3ApproachabilityIdeal}_S(\\kappa,I)\\leftrightarrow I=\\{A\\subseteq\\kappa\\mid\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachabilityIdealMember}_S(\\kappa,A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ideal is defined extensionally from the canonical membership predicate, which includes regular uncountability, one shared approximation sequence, and the required club-modulo clause.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachability-ideal-member","status":"resolved","id":"43dc0a00cf0bc7e0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-pcf4-approachability-ideal-member]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachabilityIdealMember}_S","display":false},{"tex":"I[\\kappa]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3ApproachabilityIdeal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}approachability\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner3ApproachabilityIdeal}_S(\\kappa,I)\\leftrightarrow I=\\{A\\subseteq\\kappa\\mid\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ApproachabilityIdealMember}_S(\\kappa,A)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1118,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2362","loc